9%) — Qwen3.5-122B / Nemotron-3-120B / DeepSeek-V3.2-671B를 능가. 누적 다운로드 96,000+. 자발적 커뮤니티 파생 400+종 — 한국 기업 중 허깅페이스 커뮤니티 파급력 1위."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/VIDraft/AI/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"84635ec6bf190a97ebfd45723269fa1ddad33306ddb3bf60595434ccaa48ab83","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:41:46.498Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:41:46.498Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"VIDRAFT (비드래프트) is a Korean AI research company building two pillars toward AGI: Darwin — an evolutionary model family of 18 official releases (1.7B–36B MoE multimodal) and 400+ community-derived variants, ranked #3 globally on GPQA Diamond (Darwin-27B-Opus, 86.9%). AETHER — the world's first LLM architecture integrating 5, 7, and 11 heterogeneous attention types into a single Latin Square grid (Adaptive Eleven-way Triple-symmetric Hybrid attEntion Routing). 11 patents pending (KIPO + PCT), 2 papers under submission, 9 production services live.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/VIDraft/AI/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"84635ec6bf190a97ebfd45723269fa1ddad33306ddb3bf60595434ccaa48ab83","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/VIDraft/AI/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:41:46.498Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T13:07:17.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/VIDraft/AI/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:41:46.498Z","hash":"84635ec6bf190a97ebfd45723269fa1ddad33306ddb3bf60595434ccaa48ab83","originalBytes":6834,"storedBytes":6834,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["darwin","aether","attention","korea","vidraft","diamond","evolutionary","gpqa","hybrid","llm","model","models","darwin-27b-opus","global","latin","square","training","agi","bench","huggingface","moe","pct","routing","world","adaptive","architecture","cross-architecture","darwin-31b-opus","family","final","first","full","kipo","korean","mamba",